## CIVILIZATION C: THE EGYPTIAN DYNASTIES

Historical inspiration:
Selected periods of ancient Egyptian civilization. The campaign must identify the historical period being represented rather than mixing thousands of years of Egyptian history indiscriminately.

Environment:
The Nile Valley, fertile floodplains, arid surroundings, and desert trade routes.

